			(property "Description" "Small-signal/logic-level N-FET, SOT-23 (1=G 2=S 3=D, the real 2N7002/BSS138/AO3400A pinout). Generic reusable symbol for a SOT-23 N-channel MOSFET: a load switch (e.g. AO3400A low-side fan switch, LCSC C20917) or an open-drain drive/level-shift FET (2N7002 C8545, BSS138 C112239 -- see modules/ent-kvm-carrier)."
